iveVsFixed shows the honest comparison. Backtest longs the top decile ~quarterly vs equal-weight universe. Causal; survivorship-biased; annual fundamentals + 60-day lag; simplified costs. IC = rank corr of score vs 63-day forward return. Not a forecast."}